Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:42.99,Signs,,0,0,0,,TICKET DISPENSERS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:52.99,Signs,,0,0,0,,HISUI PHARMACY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So many guys here!\NWe're gonna have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it isn't raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The fireworks will begin\Nin a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky that our trip\Ncoincided with the fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making summer memories\Nwith you, Yoshioka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's a great day.\NThe hotel even lent us yukatas to wear!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your cue, Hidaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You look really cute in it, Kaori.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yoshioka's more beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, you've made my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.76,0:01:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's watch fireworks next year too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That was such a fun trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Would've been better if\NHidaka hadn't come, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I guess I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's sad that I can't remember\Nmuch of the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All that fun has worn you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But being cheerful is my\Nonly redeeming feature!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't worry so much.\NShe's seen a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm the one who suggested the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but I bet Kaori was\Ngiving off "I wanna go!" vibes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the power of love to make her better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, good luck in your exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You simply have to pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then become rich and powerful,\Nand look after me and Kaori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want a crème caramel!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've bought crème caramels\Nlike Kaori wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yoshioka. She looks a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Hidaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're burning up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoshioka, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here already, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, where's your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lay me on the sofa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wet a towel, to cool you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd just seen a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Kaori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:07:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Her mom told me how\Nyou've been taking care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be with your secret lover\Nwhile she's suffering like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, so go back to her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she has her mom with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, I said! My mom and dad\Nwill be home soon, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me stay with you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't Yoshioka tell me\Nthat she's sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've gone right over\Nto take care of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've bought her favorite ice cream,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I have an excuse\Nto go to her place!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to someone telling me\Nthey saw her at the doctor's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel a bit better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.\NLooks like the medicine's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me if you want me\Nto do something, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hands—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't buzz her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna surprise her,\Nso I'll use the passkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even your girlfriend,\Nbut I'm keeping you to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you're so kind\Nthat I wanna be spoiled by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only your sidepiece,\Nused by you to satisfy your urges.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My cold's all better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop. I didn't come here for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? We can feel good together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.37,0:09:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't I turn you on anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:09:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bored with my body already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for this.\NYou should be resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being so kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's making this weird for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.\NPlease don't be kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep on being kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll make me jealous of Kaori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:04.99,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(975,0)\bord3.5\blur0.5\fs40\an2\pos(960,979)}Presented by ToonsHub
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"Random Word Ghost Story"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaori's tale
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's telling the next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I do it? Then Takeru,\Nyou can go last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose moments in the story\Nwhen a funny word would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And I say the word instead of\Nwhat I was gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right.\N- Make it a good one, Kaori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom heard this from a friend of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened to her when\Nshe was a university student.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One summer, she went on a date with\Nher boyfriend from her student society.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of society was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"Olympic torchbearer"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,An Olympic torchbearing society!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- They couldn't just run?\N- But carry torches too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of them went for a drive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and found an old, abandoned building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,An abandoned building?\NA classic ghost story location!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nobody else\Naround there that they could see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But as members of the\NOlympic Torchbearer Society,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they were intrigued, and went in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?!\N- It was probably an occult society.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't seem to be scared,\Nbut she definitely was,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and clung to his arm as they went in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She was trembling inside\Nas they explored deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When suddenly, they heard a noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ripped"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make it difficult for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,As they slowly ventured forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,they suddenly heard this noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"D-ripped!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.14,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"D-ripped!" The sound of\Nd-ripping water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"D-ripped!" The sound of\Nd-ripping water.\NWater?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They could hear it inside of their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"D-ripped, d-ripped!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bit of a stretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't playing fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as she heard the sound,\Nthe air became very chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She got goosebumps, and instinctively\Nreached for her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But he wasn't there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"Why? What's going on?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In her panic, she noticed\Na doll lying at her feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In the gloom of the room,\Nthe doll seemed to be looking at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A cursed doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing the 10,000-yen bill doll—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of doll?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:15:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Instantly, she understood that\Nher boyfriend had become the doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As if she were blinded by money!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,By the power of love,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,she knew that he'd been\Nturned into a 10,000-yen bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The air was getting colder and colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Only she could save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Her love conquered her fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and she grabbed the doll and ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A dash with the cash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She could still hear the noise\Ngrowing louder and louder in her head!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"D-ripped, d-ripped!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're breaking the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She ran till she could run no more,\Nmanaging to reach the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"Thank goodness!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"Is my turned-into-money\Nboyfriend alright?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Huh? This is weird."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't have the 10,000-yen bill."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.79,0:15:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"How come? Where's he gone?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But in her fear and confusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,she felt a hand on her shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She turned to see her boyfriend,\Nwho had mysteriously reappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Where did you go?!"\N- "I was gonna ask you that!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he explained...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that she had disappeared at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking she'd gone back to the car,\Nhe went looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And then he was surprised\Nto see her coming out of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The story's suddenly turned scary again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! It's a proper ghost story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with those weird words!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You told it well, too. I enjoyed that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did I manage to scare you?\N- Yes, a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.13,0:16:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you, Tomoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.16,0:16:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,he lost sight of her\Nat the entrance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.27,0:16:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.73,0:16:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,who did she go inside with?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,L-L-Let's hear your story, Takeru!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.28,0:17:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be tough to top yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoko! Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just carry on, Yoshioka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've bought too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I always binge-buy\Nat the convenience store...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,when I'm tired and hungry\Nfrom exam revision?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going? Don't study too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat yummy food to raise your spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kaori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Thanks! I'm gonna study\Nfor a little while longer."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gone a little too crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:18:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"Takeru's Special Feast"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I love that food gets discounted\Nat convenience stores at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, carbonara was 20% off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I couldn't help\Nbuying mapo tofu too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,if I combine them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoko's Hot Tip of Advice\NPeople start acting weird late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've— I've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mapo tofu on carbonara!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Car-mapo-nara!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it taste?\NOnly one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.57,0:18:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? They clash less than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The extra liquid from the mapo\Nhelps the pasta slip down my throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And the flavor's surprisingly mild.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The spiciness of the Sichuan cuisine\Nis tempered by the creamy sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Two distinct flavors in\Namazingly good harmony!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try the bacon next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.33,0:19:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The usual impact of the carbonara bacon\Nis overwhelmed by the mapo's flavor...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.83,0:19:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and it just tastes like plain meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.17,0:19:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong the seasoning,\Nit's no match for Chinese spice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fascinating.\NStill tastes great, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,With the tofu, the mapo tastes completely\Ndifferent from how it did with the pasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,With the pasta, it made it\Neasier to swallow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But with the tofu, I feel like\N"Wow, mapo's so delicious!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A knockout punch to my taste buds!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:19:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,cheese goes well with mapo too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A leftover slice of cheese\Nfrom the fridge to the dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.63,0:20:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing! It's like the flavor's\Nexploding in my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This guilty pleasure has reached\Na whole new level!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.93,0:20:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely different from\Ncheese on pizza or gratin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mapo and cheese are actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.73,0:20:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,best buddies!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That was superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good enough to release onto the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless is was my ravenous hunger\Nmessing with my sense of taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I gotta tell Kaori\Nall about it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeru, the Sichuan pepper\Ntastes awful with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't go with the carbonara at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.68,0:21:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,not to add the pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I put it all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.23,0:21:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued

